  itemId: block_harvester
  displayName: Harvester
  description: Automated crop picker. Scans 8 m for mature Tilled Soil, Seed Planter
    trays and Tree Farming Plots, harvests them, replants the same crop, clears a
    bed whose crop was lost, and pushes the yield into adjacent belts, chutes or
    pipes. A full belt is a wait, never a lost harvest. ~40 W.
